0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과 복수전공은 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">50</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학점 이상 이수</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: -40.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40.1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">주전공 과목이 복수전공 과목과 동일한</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학부 지정</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">경우 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">9</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학점까지 복수전공 학점으로 인정함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">다만</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0p